<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds gain but offer highs.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds gain but offer highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>1750 GMT - Bonds closed firmer but off highs as T-bonds and Bunds dip on new U.S. economic data seen as raising possibility of rate hike there. Long end seen holding 115 bps gap with Bund. *March 97 up 24 basis points at 107.60 *Feb 07 cash 98.70 vs 98.55. Yld 6.81 vs 6.83 *Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -10 bps vs -9 bps</p>
</text>
